WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Flymake marks an error on line 2

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.300
In the menu (C-c c ?), e sends the diagnostic with the code around it

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.300
Claude answers and proposes an edit

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.800
The edit waits for permission

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:25.500
Allowing it makes the edit, and the buffer shows it

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.300
The checker runs again and finds nothing
